(text "Slot bank limiter TPS48100 (VBAT_P -> VBAT_SLOTS, 5 mOhm + 19.6k:\n9.2/11.6/14.4 A, 10 nF + 100k latch-off ~148 us). Each slot: TPS48100 + 2x\nBSC070N10NS5 + 5 mOhm (24.3k: 10.7/13.6/16.6 A, 4.7 nF + 100k latch-off ~70\nus) from VBAT_SLOTS; TPS2553 210k (+3V3 main, 110-150 mA). No +5V slot rail\n(a8/b8 reserved). PWR_EN = NOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (1G02); OUT_EN_N =\nNAND(PWR_EN, GLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW, NOT ARM_N) (1G04 + 1G10). +3V3_ID via 150R\n0805." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 631.19 194.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ab42f1b4-ca76-4950-8a3b-76bbb2e5cfe3"))
